      "published_at": "2026-11-11T15:01:51Z",
      "body": "## TabStation 2.18.20\n\n- Notification groups you unfolded in Notification Center (or Action Center) are stacked again the next time you open it, like on macOS.\n\nRequires Android 10+. Shizuku is recommended. Install over the previous version; settings are kept. TabStation updates itself from Settings → Version & updates.\n",
